target: skills/review/review-loop/review-stats.py
verify: cd skills/review/review-loop && ./review-stats.test.sh
expect: a deliberate skip is not reported as a failure to complete
why:    collapsing the two buckets reports every accounted-for decline as a failure to complete, which is the original defect — all five of the alarm's reported misses of record_reviewed were of exactly this kind, and none was real
--- old
            if st in DECLINED_STATES:
                declined[g] += 1
                decline_why[g].add(st)
            else:
                dropped[g] += 1
                drop_why[g].add(st)
--- new
            dropped[g] += 1
            drop_why[g].add(st)
